# Codex Integration Instructions For Claude Code

Claude Code should treat this repository as shared with Codex.

Before work:

1. Read `AGENT_STATUS.md`.
2. Read `INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md`.
3. Read `references/SHARED_CONTEXT.json`.
4. Read relevant `.codex/*` files.

After work:

1. Update `.codex/CHANGELOG.md` and `.codex/HANDOFF.md`.
2. Update `.codex/DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md` or `.codex/FEATURE_GUARDS.md` only when needed.
3. Update master coordination files.
4. Do not edit `.claude/*` unless Claude Code runtime instructions, permissions, agents, or skills changed.
